      ],
      "content": "SP 90 SW              CHARTRIDGE              COGDELLS LANE 5/45                                          Cogdells Farmhouse                                               and attached barn - -                                             II Small house.  C17 altered.  Timber framed, cement rendered, the left hand bay flint and brick, perhaps added early C19.  Old tile roof, central chimney, lobby entry plan.  One storey and attic, modern open porch, projecting chimney to right, one small window.  Exposed timbers at right hand end.  Projecting chimney stack to left hand gable.  Rear elevation has three casements to ground floor, dormers above. Interior:  large inglenook fireplace, chamfered spine beams.  Barn attached at rear, C18 altered; timber framed weatherboarded, tiled roof. Listing NGR: SP9287903507"
    }
  ],
